# Styles: the same lines for every look. There is no `look` line on purpose;
# the styles page locks each stage to one look so they can be compared by eye.

scene show figure lines=3 neutral steady
circle sun 26,32 8 fill=accent
path hill thick=1.5 | M8 72 Q25 46 44 64 T76 60
rect 54,32 14x14 fill=dim
pix at=76,74 scale=1.2
| .88.88.
| 8888888
| 8888888
| .88888.
| ..888..
| ...8...
say label near=sun:below | accent
say title | Same lines
say | Only the *look* changes: ground, inks, face, surface.
say aside | size, colour, stroke and texture belong to the look
